# Verifies the tap on the search-result row routed to ClimbDetail
# (not e.g. SetterDetail or a different climb's detail). The companion
# .entity-proof requires the dynamic UUID to be identical across
# NAV START, load start, load complete, and NAV COMPLETE. No catalogue UUID is
# pinned, so blob refreshes cannot make the proof stale.
🧭 NAV START: BoardBrowser → ClimbDetail\(
🧭 .*BoardClimbDetailVM\.init start
🧭 .*loadClimb start
🧭 .*loadClimb complete
🧭 .*NAV COMPLETE: BoardClimbDetail\(
